      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sounds like you created a driver to implement different page-in/page-out policies. Why can\u0027t all this be done from the userspace using madvise() syscalls? That would be the stadard way of doing such things and would keep policy decisions in the userspace.\n\nIf you don\u0027t want to discuss that in public AOSP, feel free to move this discussion into the associated bug.",
